       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppnnmmssccaallee  was  obsoleted  by  ppaammssccaallee(1), introduced with Netpbm 10.20
       (January 2004).  ppaammssccaallee is backward compatible  with  ppnnmmssccaallee,  plus
       adds  many  additional  functions, including the ability to process PAM
       images.

       ppnnmmssccaallee remained in the Netpbm package until Netpbm 10.46 (March 2009)
       because  of  hopes  that it had fewer bugs than ppaammssccaallee because of its
       age.  But now it would just be clutter.

       In Netpbm before 10.20, use the  manual  for  ppaammssccaallee  with  ppnnmmssccaallee.
       Features  that are in ppaammssccaallee but not ppnnmmssccaallee are indicated by state‐
       ments that they didn't exist before 10.20.

